{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aDiceyhacker 1999\u300b is a cyberpunk roguelite game that blends idle/incremental mechanics with dice-driven strategy, featuring humorous gadgets and a unique visual style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting from the urban legend of the \u200b**&quot;1999 Non-Disclosure Agreement&quot;**, this game unfolds in a diverged parallel universe timeline where you play as a hacker battling corporate entities that control the world\u2014and the shadowy masterminds behind them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>\u3010Use your arsenal of devices to breach target networks and seize resources\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726190/extras/6f9b14e19441f5d6d54994d8e7908633.poster.avif?t=1754279976\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726190/extras/6f9b14e19441f5d6d54994d8e7908633.webm?t=1754279976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726190/extras/6f9b14e19441f5d6d54994d8e7908633.mp4?t=1754279976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Explore the World! \u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amass your assets and launch assaults on dark web strongholds across the globe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726190/extras/f9c810a59449299ddef38b4c50af1fd1.avif?t=1754279976\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Mysterious Encounter! \u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Within this enigmatic dark web realm, dangers and oppo